1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,200
Can you sneak up on a dragonfly? From behind, it can't see me!

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,038
Crumb only sees its back.

3
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:10,229
But Zip can see Crumb! Oh no!

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:13,457
Its big eyes see almost all around!

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,297
Six legs? In you go!

6
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,700
Oh! I scared myself! Can YOU sneak up on Zip?
